---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-20 bg-navy text-cream">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-12">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <p class="text-lg font-bold">HomeTime<span class="text-gold">Jobs</span></p>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm text-slate-light">
          Driver-first CDL jobs, organized around the thing that actually decides it ... when you get home.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gold">Learn</p>
        <ul class="mt-1 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/home-time/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-gold">Home Time Explained</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pay/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-gold">How Driver Pay Works</a></li>
          <li><a href="/carriers/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-gold">Compare Carriers</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-gold">Company</p>
        <ul class="mt-1 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/about/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-gold">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#apply" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-gold">Get Matched</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-gold">Privacy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/transparency/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center hover:text-gold">Transparency</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-slate-light">
      &copy; {year} HomeTimeJobs - a Paul Ann Media company. All rights reserved. Photos on this site are AI-generated illustrations.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
